Third-party material
--------------------

None identified. This is a clean-room reimplementation: it carries graph
structure only, and vendors no third-party source, figures or datasets.

Data format
-----------

data/reference/generated_topologies/*.pkl and data/reference/reward_networks/*.h5
are Python pickle and Keras HDF5 files. Both formats execute code on load. Load
only copies you obtained from this repository.
